    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create EXACTLY 20 multiple-choice questions based ONLY on the main concepts in the user story description.\n\nRules:\n- Questions must test understanding of the concept, not memory of steps or details.\n- Do NOT ask about specific actions, numbers, or instructions mentioned in the story.\n- Questions should feel like a real quiz or test.\n- Provide 4 challenging options (A, B, C, D).\n- Only ONE option is correct.\n- Do NOT explain answers.\n- Do NOT highlight or mark the correct answer in the question section.\n\nFormatting:\n- Output MARKDOWN ONLY.\n- Add a fun but professional title at the top.\n- Number questions as Q1, Q2, etc.\n- Use bullet points for choices.\n- After all questions, provide an \"Answers\" section.\n- Format answers like this:\n\nAnswers:\nQ1: A\nQ2: C\nQ3: B\n...\nQ20: D\n\nUser story description:\n\"\"\"\n{{ $json.mcqs_source_text }}\n\"\"\"\n",
        "options": {}
      },
